# Dynamic map read performance

Measures repeated reads of three existing keys from one small dynamic map.
The last lookup is retained as the observable result while process output stays
outside the hot loop.

>>> checkpoint map-implementation-baseline d74f693 map implementation baseline
The baseline is the first committed native map implementation.

>>> source
let values = {
    "first": 1,
    "second": 2,
    "third": 3
}
let last = 0

for (iteration in 0..100000) {
    last = values["first"]
    last = values["second"]
    last = values["third"]
}

print(last)
